Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,-- Usagi Drop 01 --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.08,0:00:28.00,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What was that?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.72,0:00:41.01,Mail,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(772,493)}Kawachi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.72,0:00:40.54,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Ok, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.54,0:00:42.07,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I just woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.02,0:00:46.15,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I see. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.03,0:00:50.57,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.57,0:00:54.47,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We'll talk things over with them early next week, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.15,0:00:57.37,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.19,0:01:07.89,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}My grandfather, from my mother's side, passed away last night.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.89,0:01:14.48,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Was that him I was dreaming about earlier? And my mom?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.02,0:01:24.89,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I heard he sort of distanced himself from the rest of the family.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.60,0:01:50.75,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The one time I come back home is for a funeral...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.91,0:03:57.34,Presented By,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(165,0)\blur0.4\pos(591,290)}Presented by:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.91,0:03:57.34,Presented By,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(165,0)\blur0.4\pos(777,290)}Taka Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.62,0:04:27.33,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.32,0:04:29.83,MainLow,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Daikichi? That was quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.85,0:04:32.07,MainLow,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You can put your bags in Grandpa's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.07,0:04:33.46,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:36.12,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I saw a young girl out in the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.15,0:04:39.36,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is she Haruko's?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.25,0:04:42.30,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's not Reina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.03,0:04:44.54,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Then who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.97,0:04:50.01,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Sheesh, this kitchen is hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.47,0:04:59.48,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,What should we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.48,0:05:02.32,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,At 79, he lived a good, long life, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.32,0:05:06.14,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,That girl is Grandpa's illegitimate child.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.14,0:05:07.00,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.00,0:05:09.95,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's Grandpa's child?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.95,0:05:14.46,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,He never said a word about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.45,0:05:16.86,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,And we don't even know where his lover is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.86,0:05:20.16,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,His lover? He was 79, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.17,0:05:23.67,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Sheesh, I can't decide if it's embarrassing or just shameful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.67,0:05:27.42,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,So that girl is your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.42,0:05:30.34,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Which makes her my aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.35,0:05:32.18,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing funny about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.14,0:05:36.98,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You're 30 years old! You know\Nbetter than to make jokes like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.04,0:06:05.59,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You really did die peacefully, didn't you, Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.69,0:06:28.32,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,How much should I give?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.32,0:06:31.99,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't matter. Any amount will help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.99,0:06:35.55,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,I know that, but isn't there some usual amount people give?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.54,0:06:38.00,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Really, any amount will help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.00,0:06:43.92,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Though recently, sutra recitations and the giving of a posthumous name have become quite expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.77,0:06:50.03,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,She recommended between 40,000 and 50,000 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.03,0:06:53.13,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,That's quite a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.14,0:06:55.39,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Good to see you all after so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.39,0:06:57.93,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, it's sure been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.93,0:07:00.30,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Have you been busy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.30,0:07:01.89,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.89,0:07:05.85,Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,So busy you can't visit your own mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.66,0:07:09.32,Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,You weren't even here for New Year's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.71,0:07:11.69,Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.82,0:07:14.99,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.71,0:07:20.19,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it, Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.19,0:07:21.47,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.47,0:07:24.79,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Dai-chan, it's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.79,0:07:26.18,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.12,0:07:24.79,Overlap,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.10,0:07:29.30,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I've got you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.30,0:07:31.73,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Now be a good girl and stay quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.73,0:07:32.71,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,No, I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.71,0:07:33.78,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.78,0:07:35.66,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.09,0:07:42.66,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You just look a lot like Grandpa when he was young.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.48,0:07:51.86,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,So Daikichi, did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.86,0:07:53.53,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, my mom told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.53,0:07:55.99,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,But is it really true?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.99,0:08:00.45,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I know my older brother felt lonely living alone, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.45,0:08:02.64,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,He left behind a child care book.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:04.46,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,It says her name is Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.46,0:08:08.43,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Still, how could a 79 year-old man do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.43,0:08:15.14,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, regardless of whether he could have done it or not, you've gotta hand it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.14,0:08:19.10,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, would you bring the cushions from the closet, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.10,0:08:19.89,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.00,0:08:50.88,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.70,0:09:16.18,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, wanna trade?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.18,0:09:20.52,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! Just leave it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.13,0:09:25.58,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.04,0:09:31.67,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Look! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.67,0:09:33.93,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Don't run, Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.93,0:09:36.42,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, that's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.42,0:09:37.58,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.58,0:09:41.74,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Very! You sure are good at cat's cradle, Reina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.59,0:09:46.83,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Now try a four-step ladder!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.26,0:09:52.76,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Here, Reina-chan, let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.76,0:09:55.10,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Poop bomb! {lol?}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.10,0:09:56.63,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Come back here, Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.61,0:10:47.55,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wake up, Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.55,0:10:49.95,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead and get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.95,0:10:51.86,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll watch over the incense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.86,0:10:54.18,Main,Uncle,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.51,0:10:58.80,Main,Uncle,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, don't sleep here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.28,0:11:02.56,Main,Uncle,0000,0000,0000,,Let's rest over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.56,0:11:04.24,Main,Uncle,0000,0000,0000,,What about the incense?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.24,0:11:07.25,Main,Uncle,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi said he'll watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.25,0:11:09.04,Main,Uncle,0000,0000,0000,,Come on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.23,0:11:13.00,Main,Uncle,0000,0000,0000,,Watch over my older brother, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.83,0:11:22.37,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Go sleep over there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:26.33,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.43,0:11:29.66,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You don't look fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.47,0:11:48.01,Board,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.7\frx2\fry338\pos(635,695)}Kaga\N\N\N\NSouichi
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.43,0:11:58.75,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, please offer your final farewells.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.20,0:12:05.78,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.80,0:12:07.54,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.54,0:12:11.15,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I'll see you again very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.45,0:12:14.74,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Come, Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.75,0:12:16.00,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.21,0:12:20.67,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Go say bye to Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.67,0:12:22.37,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.62,0:12:30.38,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Flower garden!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.38,0:12:32.03,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.01,0:12:37.61,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,No! I want to make a flower garden!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.61,0:12:40.04,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.11,0:12:50.74,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You should say goodbye too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.13,0:13:13.99,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Put this on Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.25,0:13:25.27,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.58,0:13:43.02,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}A bellflower?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.26,0:13:46.92,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Grandpa's favorite flower...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.57,0:14:11.70,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa will love this flower the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.81,0:14:16.33,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,He won't wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.91,0:14:25.59,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, he won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.44,0:14:41.55,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}You really are Grandpa's child, aren't you?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:04.10,Handbook,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.5\pos(790,180)\frx32\fry352\frz335.278}Maternity and Child\NCare Handbook
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:04.10,Names,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.3\pos(586,460)}Kaga Souichi
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:04.10,Names,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.3\pos(566,479)}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:04.10,Names,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.3\pos(511,502)}Rin
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:04.10,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Where did this "Yoshii Masako" go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.10,0:16:10.48,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what the point in trying to find\Nsomeone who left their child and ran away is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.48,0:16:13.07,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,She has no sense of responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.07,0:16:17.09,MainLow,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,My brother was also really stubborn about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.87,0:16:35.86,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.23,0:16:39.41,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,That girl can't talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.41,0:16:40.66,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,It's such a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.66,0:16:42.77,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,She hasn't even lost her baby teeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.77,0:16:44.59,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She {\i1}can{\i0} talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.60,0:16:46.06,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And she's not a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.06,0:16:47.80,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,No, she can't talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:51.96,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,It's so boring being with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.03,0:16:56.74,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Here, take all of these and go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.74,0:17:00.58,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,It's like you own a candy shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.58,0:17:02.72,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry about that, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.62,0:17:05.54,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Later on is one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.54,0:17:08.54,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,but who's going to watch over that girl right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.54,0:17:11.97,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I can't. I'm at the store all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.97,0:17:15.85,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,I would if she was a more proper girl. {TLC}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.85,0:17:18.57,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Not to mention she has a hard time talking. {lit. her speech is a little delayed}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.57,0:17:19.55,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.55,0:17:24.22,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're always at home. Couldn't you watch her for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:27.53,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.52,0:17:29.98,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not as free as you think!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.98,0:17:34.44,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, do you have any idea how hard it is to raise a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.44,0:17:39.01,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you know how much I've had to sacrifice over the years?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.99,0:17:42.24,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,I'd feel bad for the girl if she was looked after half-heartedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.04,0:17:47.66,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Wasn't the point of this meeting to\Nfigure out who would look after Rin?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.66,0:17:52.63,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like you have any intention of taking her in, do you, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.63,0:17:54.80,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,Be realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.80,0:18:01.51,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,We're not even sure that she's really Grandpa's child.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.51,0:18:05.53,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,See? You haven't even considered everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.13,0:18:44.30,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I say we try putting her in a care facility as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.17,0:18:52.98,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.40,0:19:05.50,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.71,0:19:21.97,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wanna come stay with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.97,0:19:23.78,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.76,0:19:24.72,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,Brother?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.85,0:20:15.06,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Old man, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.06,0:20:17.52,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Old man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.52,0:20:20.25,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't call me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.98,0:20:26.18,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're my aunt, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.64,0:22:04.00,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Good?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.00,0:22:05.13,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.27,0:22:10.54,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You want more?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.54,0:22:11.72,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.72,0:22:14.12,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There's only rice left.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.12,0:22:15.89,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make rice balls then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.89,0:22:19.39,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing left to fill it with.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.39,0:22:20.77,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Salt!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.77,0:22:22.86,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Salt?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.49,0:22:27.95,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, it's still hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.94,0:22:29.82,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.82,0:22:33.79,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It'll make it taste softer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.79,0:22:36.74,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.74,0:22:40.12,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.12,0:22:42.46,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Daikichi doesn't sound right either.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.20,0:22:50.22,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.22,0:22:52.22,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,
